category: Libs
requires: cygwin libcurl4 libgcc1 libssl3 libstdc++6 libuuid1 libxml2
sdesc: "High-performance file management over WebDAV / HTTP (runtime)"
ldesc: "Davix aims to make the task of managing files over HTTP-based protocols
simple. It is being developed by IT-ST at CERN, and while the project's
purpose is its use on the CERN grid, the functionality offered is generic."
external-source: davix

